---
// Quiz figure for Post 3 set 01: board row snapshot with ref 30,000, current 29,400 (red), user cost 24,000.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq03bc">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 205" role="img" aria-label="Price board snapshot for ticker MBB: reference 30,000, ceiling 32,100, floor 27,900, last match 29,400 (-2% red), against investor entry price 24,000.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Board row snapshot vs your own portfolio cost</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ảnh chụp bảng điện so với giá vốn trong danh mục của bạn</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="42" width="548" height="72" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="52" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">TC / Ref</text>
    <text x="52" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t" style="fill: var(--gold);">30,000</text>

    <text x="155" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">Bid 1</text>
    <text x="155" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t" style="fill: var(--red);">29,350 × 4k</text>

    <text x="290" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Matched</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="290" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t" style="fill: var(--red);">29,400 (−2%)</text>

    <text x="425" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">Ask 1</text>
    <text x="425" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t" style="fill: var(--red);">29,450 × 2k</text>

    <text x="522" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">Ceil / Floor</text>
    <text x="522" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">32.1 / 27.9</text>

    <rect x="16" y="130" width="548" height="58" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="164" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Your portfolio line: bought 1,000 shares last month @ 24,000 VND (+22.5%)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Danh mục của bạn: đã mua 1.000 CP tháng trước giá 24.000 đ (+22,5%)</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq03bc { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq03bc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq03bc text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq03bc .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq03bc .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq03bc .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .qfig-sbq03bc .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
</style>
